Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.57,0:00:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler 1 to Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Multiple enemy interceptor\Ngroups at points 30 and 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battalion-sized units of\NLuvas and Growlwolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All Juggernauts, advance\Nimmediately and take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, though, with that many of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of you\Nare coming back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, you pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight until your bodies break!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,86, Scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.41,0:00:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,(Screaming.)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As anyone out by day can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's another beautiful day in all\N85 districts around the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not enjoy some fun with\Nyour friends and family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clear skies might not complete\Nyour whole crew tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can keep those umbrellas at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a great weekend, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, for today's War Update\Nfrom San Magnolia Military HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invasion of the Giardian Empire's\Nmechanized infantry drones, also known
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as Legion, attacked in Combat District\N17 and has been repelled by our nation's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unmanned combat units. the great and\Npowerful juggernauts and this blow delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to their forces came\Nat minimal cost thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to our advanced ethically responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drone units; our nation has suffered\Nzero human fatalities; the day is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,near when our righteous and just\Nnation will finally smash the last
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remnants of the wicked empire; glory to\NSon Magnolia and the five-color flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, real men; hold on, hold\Non; oh, Major, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet I know my way around,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry; they were really crying\Ntheir heads off yesterday; Goddamn pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.87,0:03:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fight was insane; I\Nbet I lost five of the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things; lucky for us that\Nno people were on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, guys The doll-loving princess\Nhas given us the evil eye Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major Millie Zay; why the long\Nface? you shouldn't cry over
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a few busted up drones; listen here;\Ngood morning; good morning; Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up early today. You usually\Nsleep in. Work had me up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike those morons i do my\Njob just forget about those jer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ks this isn't the battlefield\Nwe're inside the grand mur.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the enemy will be gone in\Ntwo years. If anything, you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weirdo for taking all this\Nmilitary stuff so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply think this\Ncountry's conscience has…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you do, Miss Serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not awake enough to listen\Nto another one of your speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glorified gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, screw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when do District\N1 men like us have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to the bitching of\Nthe pigs in District 86.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much about the\Ndrones? and how they're treated, Lena?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both know that they aren't drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try that again, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it you care so much about the 86?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battlefield is calling, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confirming ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major Vladilena Milizé.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eastern Theater Forces, Combat District 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defense Line 3 Command\Nand Control Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pararate. Activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleiades. Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler 1 to Pleiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to be working with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleiades to Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sync channel clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's about to enter firing\Nrange, so take care not to get…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 86 are inhuman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why are you always so kind to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very sweet, Miss Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to assign me to a\Nnew unit, General Karlstahl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the unit's handlers\Nis retiring from his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, a capable replacement\Nis needed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can't leave their post\Nuntil a successor is decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does that mean the unit's\Ndefending a key base?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Defense Line 1 in Eastern\NCombat District 1, a.k.a.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Spearhead Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made up of veterans from\Nall across the Eastern Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing short of an ace unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible, but I only just made major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I can\Nhandle a unit like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that as though you're not the youngest\Nperson ever to achieve the rank of major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being overly humble can\Nturn people against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena, that's good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Uncle Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:07:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Vatslav would be so proud\Nif only he could see his daughter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Margaretta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother's the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't stop telling me to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to business. We can't find a\Nsingle handler to take this post.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're an ace unit. Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't it be a high\Nhonor for any Republic…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soldier to take command of such capable…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Troops? On paper, yes, one would think so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but take a look at the\Ncommander's call sign: Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a story behind that\Nprocessor's name. A story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've taken to calling it the Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It destroys any handler who\Ntries to take control of it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The processor destroys the handler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,- Not the other way around?\N- Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not just an urban legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time in my schedule to\Nshare urban legends with my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost every handler who's\Ndealt with a unit with Undert…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aker in it has retired or\Nrequested to change units.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some have even committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they claim to be haunted\Nby the voices of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dead, you're more than\Nwelcome to turn this down, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You work too hard anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A handler's job is to monitor the\Nunit, keep their commands to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it. I'll be Spearhead's\Nnext command and control officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be doing\Nanything more than your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that matter, I wish you'd stop\Ntrying to interact with the processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a commander's job to know her men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are to stop including the number\Nof fatalities in your reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officially, there are no\Nhumans on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that there are no fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we should ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things we're doing,\Nthey're completely immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:09:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena. You really are just like\Nyour father, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Henceforth, Major Vladilena Miliz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the designated handler for Combat\NDistrict 1, handling Defense Line 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to get the paperwork done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give it my all,\Nuntil my last mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you accepted?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize how weird you are?\NCome on, it's an honor to be put in charge…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of an ace unit it's an important job and\Nthat stuff about destroying hand lers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be made up, right? I bet they\Ndidn't care about their jobs and just wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a reason to leave some of them did commit
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suicide, though. One of\Nthe spearhead squadron's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handlers went crazy and blew\Nhis own head off with a shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, exam's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another clean bill of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why commit suicide?\NWe got a request to look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into it. They thought it\Nmight be a problem with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the para-raid. Quitting\Nisn't a big deal, but a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suicide needs to be looked\NInto and I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know. I mean, the handler was already\Ndead. It's not like we could interview him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty defeatist for the head of the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,development team. “Hey,\Nwe did our job. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was nothing wrong with the raid\Ndevice. End of story.” We told them that. If
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they wanted to know more, they'd have to\Nbring us the undertaker. Those idiots and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transport were all this flight. Has\Nno available seating for pigs, so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you get to talk to undertaker\Nwe had to settle for its report
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a whole lot of nothing we told\Nit about the dead handler and its
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,response was just i see well it's\Nan 86 it's not entirely possible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a para raid could cause insanity it\Nputs extra pressure on part of the brain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to allow it to share sensory data with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone else which is\Nprecisely why we only
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use it to share hearing if you tried\Nto sink your vision too it'd burn out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your brain too much load on the brain\Nand you don't come back using the pair
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,raid means accepting those\Nrisks your father was one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.01,0:11:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,authorities in the field and\Nstill the fundamental principles
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were all developed by someone\Nelse there's a lot i even
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know to be honest\Nseriously lena you should join
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us in r&d huh the military is basically a\Njobs program right now in two years when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the legion are gone ex-military isn't\Ngoing to mean a thing on your resume thank
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you but we're in wartime right now those\Nprocessors are all nuts you know that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right and who's to say what happens on\Nthose para raids the 86 die all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i'm not worried about them but i\Ndon't want that for you running away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now would be cowardly yeah yeah you really\Nare weird i updated your settings for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you hold on lena i made chiffon\Ncake you want a slice i think i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pass today see you later even if i used\Nreal eggs and real milk it's so good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so how'd you like the real\Nthing it's amazing still i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder if this is how it really\Ntasted you forget when you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only eat the artificial stuff\Ni've got cream puffs too they
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't taste like cheese when\Nyou didn't put any in or look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to spit out black smoke, do they?\NYou wouldn't be referring to the cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puffs I made last time. Would you, my\Ndear Lena? They'll be fine this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave him to a potential marriage partner\Nyesterday, and he cried tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems like a good match for once.\NSounds to me like he really appreciates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You of course. He does. I\Nwrapped the whole batch up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A note addressed to my\Nbeloved and sealed it with a.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lipstick kiss, then put him in the\Nmailbox of the place he lives with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mistress. What's wrong? Pleiades,\Ncome in, please. Respond, Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One to Pleiades stop he's dead Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fire. Face the maneuvers! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler, one to all members\Nof squadron three. The.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy unit has commenced\Nits retreat. Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four will now take over\Nyour patrol mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regroup at once and return to base Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:14:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the seven we lost about Pleiades\NI'm so so sorry as always thank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you for your oh so kind words\NHandler One just so you know Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three is going to be re-estab\Nlished you're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be reporting to a new Handler\Nfrom here forward thank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you for everything i will be\Nthe new command and control
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,officer for spearhead that's\Ngreat news you have my deepest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sympathies handler one what do you\Nsay say hello to the reaper for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pararade, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Synchronization target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spearhead, processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,(Crickets chirping) (crickets chirping)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,(crickets chirping) (crickets\Nchirping) (crack) (laughter) Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around and start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sure having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have fun out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun out there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Members of Spearhead, it's breakfast time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,- Gather round.\N- Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got more omelets if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,- I want them!\N- Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even think he\Nchewed the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, the guy went crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That handle of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in yesterday's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no chance he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was all like, hold on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never change, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those white pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever comes next is just going\Nto do the same damn thing. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least everybody\Nwas able to go yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:17:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we're going to die anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having our beloved Reaper\Nguide us isn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noooooooooooooooooooooooooooo\Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo oooooo…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shin…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me you won't forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was cujo able to go yeah you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hear your brother's voice no i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, none left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handler One to all spearhead units.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings. I am your new\Ncommand and control officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I contacted you tonight\Nto introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Spearhead\NSquadron's combat commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call sign, Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been informed that\Nwe'd have a new Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:22:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spearhead.
